{"seq":1,"slug":"medical-nursing","title":"大学护理学 — 内科护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/clinical-nursing/medical-nursing","wordCount":1905,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学护理学-内科护理\">大学护理学 — 内科护理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>内科护理是临床护理的主干分支，涵盖呼吸系统、循环系统、消化系统、泌尿系统、内分泌系统、血液系统和神经系统等各系统常见疾病的护理。内科疾病往往具有慢性化、反复发作和多系统受累的特点，这对护理的连续性和系统性提出了更高要求。内科护士不仅需要精准的病情观察能力和扎实的药物知识，还需要出色的健康教育技能——帮助患者建立自我管理意识和能力，是内科护理区别于外科护理的核心特征。</p>\n<p>核心内容覆盖：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>呼吸系统</strong>：COPD、哮喘、肺炎的护理评估与干预</li>\n<li><strong>循环系统</strong>：高血压、冠心病、心力衰竭的护理管理</li>\n<li><strong>消化系统</strong>：消化性溃疡、肝硬化的护理要点</li>\n<li><strong>内分泌系统</strong>：糖尿病的综合护理管理</li>\n<li><strong>急危重症</strong>：急性心肌梗死、糖尿病酮症酸中毒的急救护理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-呼吸系统疾病护理\">一、呼吸系统疾病护理</h3><p><strong>慢性阻塞性肺疾病（COPD）护理</strong>：</p>\n<p>COPD 是以持续性气流受限为特征的慢性呼吸系统疾病。护理评估重点包括：呼吸困难程度（mMRC 分级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\sim 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 级）、咳痰情况、运动耐力、营养状态和心理状况。</p>\n<p>氧疗是 COPD 的重要治疗手段，但需注意持续低流量吸氧（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\sim 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> L/min），维持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>88</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>92</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">88\\% \\sim 92\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">88%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">92%</span></span></span></span></span>。原因是 COPD 患者长期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 潴留，呼吸中枢对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 敏感性下降，主要依靠低氧刺激驱动呼吸——高浓度吸氧会消除低氧刺激，抑制呼吸。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>护理问题</th>\n<th>护理措施</th>\n<th>评价指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>气体交换受损</td>\n<td>低流量吸氧、缩唇呼吸训练、体位引流</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>88</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2 \\geq 88\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">88%</span></span></span></span></span>，呼吸困难减轻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清理呼吸道无效</td>\n<td>有效咳嗽指导、雾化吸入、拍背排痰</td>\n<td>痰液量减少，肺部听诊改善</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活动无耐力</td>\n<td>渐进式运动锻炼、呼吸操</td>\n<td>6分钟步行距离增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营养失调</td>\n<td>高蛋白高热量饮食、少量多餐</td>\n<td>体重稳定，白蛋白正常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>哮喘急性发作的急救护理</strong>：立即取坐位或半坐卧位 → 吸氧 → 协助使用速效 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 受体激动剂（如沙丁胺醇 MDI 吸入）→ 遵医嘱全身糖皮质激素 → 监测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和呼吸频率 → 记录发作时间和用药反应。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-循环系统疾病护理\">二、循环系统疾病护理</h3><p><strong>心力衰竭的护理管理</strong>：</p>\n<p>慢性心力衰竭的护理围绕&quot;减轻心脏负荷、改善心功能、提高生活质量&quot;三大目标：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[心衰护理] --&gt; B[症状监测]&#10;    A --&gt; C[用药管理]&#10;    A --&gt; D[生活指导]&#10;    A --&gt; E[心理支持]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[每日体重/出入量监测]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[呼吸困难/水肿评估]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[利尿剂: 监测电解质]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[ACEI/ARB: 监测血压肾功能]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[β受体阻滞剂: 监测心率]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[限钠&lt;2g/天 限液&lt;1500mL]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[活动-休息平衡]\">graph TD\n    A[心衰护理] --&gt; B[症状监测]\n    A --&gt; C[用药管理]\n    A --&gt; D[生活指导]\n    A --&gt; E[心理支持]\n    B --&gt; B1[每日体重/出入量监测]\n    B --&gt; B2[呼吸困难/水肿评估]\n    C --&gt; C1[利尿剂: 监测电解质]\n    C --&gt; C2[ACEI/ARB: 监测血压肾功能]\n    C --&gt; C3[β受体阻滞剂: 监测心率]\n    D --&gt; D1[限钠&lt;2g/天 限液&lt;1500mL]\n    D --&gt; D2[活动-休息平衡]</pre><p><strong>每日体重监测</strong>是心衰患者自我管理的金标准——体重在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 天内增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> kg 提示液体潴留加重，需要及时就医。</p>\n<p><strong>急性心肌梗死的急救护理</strong>：MONA 原则——吗啡（Morphine）减轻疼痛和焦虑 → 吸氧（Oxygen）→ 硝酸甘油（Nitroglycerin）扩张冠状动脉 → 阿司匹林（Aspirin）抗血小板。同时立即建立静脉通道、连续心电监护、准备溶栓或 PCI。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-内分泌系统疾病护理\">三、内分泌系统疾病护理</h3><p><strong>糖尿病的综合护理管理</strong>：</p>\n<p>糖尿病管理的&quot;五驾马车&quot;：饮食控制、运动治疗、药物治疗、血糖监测、健康教育。护理在每个环节都发挥核心作用。</p>\n<p><strong>血糖监测与目标</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>控制目标</th>\n<th>监测频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空腹血糖</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.4</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>7.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.4 \\sim 7.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7.0</span></span></span></span></span> mmol/L</td>\n<td>胰岛素治疗者每日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>餐后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> h 血糖</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>10.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 10.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10.0</span></span></span></span></span> mmol/L</td>\n<td>根据方案调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>HbA</mtext><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>c</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HbA}_{1\\text{c}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HbA</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>7.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 7.0\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7.0%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低血糖标准</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 3.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.9</span></span></span></span></span> mmol/L</td>\n<td>随时监测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>低血糖的识别与急救</strong>：出冷汗、心悸、手抖、饥饿感 → 意识清楚者立即口服 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15 \\sim 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> g 速效碳水化合物（如葡萄糖片、果汁 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> mL）→ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟后复测 → 仍低则重复 → 意识不清者静脉推注 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span> 葡萄糖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 \\sim 40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> mL。</p>\n<p><strong>胰岛素注射指导</strong>：注射部位轮换（腹部吸收最快→上臂→大腿→臀部），同一部位间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> cm；笔式注射器垂直进针，注射后停留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 秒再拔针；胰岛素开封后室温保存，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span></span></span></span></span> 天内使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-消化系统疾病护理\">四、消化系统疾病护理</h3><p><strong>肝硬化失代偿期的护理要点</strong>：</p>\n<p>主要并发症的护理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>腹水</strong>：低钠饮食（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> g/天）、限制入液量、准确记录出入量和腹围、配合利尿治疗</li>\n<li><strong>食管-胃底静脉曲张破裂出血</strong>：三腔两囊管压迫止血护理（牵引重量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> kg、每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> h 放气 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15 \\sim 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> min、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span> h 内拔管）</li>\n<li><strong>肝性脑病</strong>：限制蛋白摄入（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5 \\sim 1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span> g/kg/天）、保持大便通畅、监测血氨、安全护理（防坠床、防自伤）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"五-内科常见急症的早期识别\">五、内科常见急症的早期识别</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>急症</th>\n<th>早期表现</th>\n<th>护士应立即采取的行动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>急性心梗</td>\n<td>胸骨后压榨性疼痛、大汗</td>\n<td>卧床休息、吸氧、含服硝酸甘油、12导心电图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脑卒中</td>\n<td>突发偏瘫、言语不清、面瘫</td>\n<td>FAST 评估、通知医生、保持呼吸道通畅、记录发病时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>糖尿病酮症酸中毒</td>\n<td>多饮多尿加重、恶心呕吐、Kussmaul 呼吸、烂苹果味</td>\n<td>建立静脉通道、快速补液、遵医嘱胰岛素持续泵入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上消化道出血</td>\n<td>呕血/黑便、心率增快、血压下降</td>\n<td>绝对卧床、建立双通道补液、禁食、备血</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一位 COPD 急性加重期患者，医嘱持续低流量吸氧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> L/min。家属要求将氧流量调高至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> L/min&quot;让患者舒服些&quot;。解释你为什么不能同意这一要求。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一份针对新确诊 2 型糖尿病患者的出院健康教育计划，覆盖饮食、运动、血糖监测和用药四个方面。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一位心衰患者晨间体重较前一天增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span> kg，双下肢凹陷性水肿加重。分析可能的原因并制定护理应对措施。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>肝硬化患者使用三腔两囊管止血期间，护士需要观察和记录哪些内容？放气时间超过规定怎么办？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用 SBAR 沟通模式（Situation-Background-Assessment-Recommendation），描述如何向主治医生报告一位急性心梗疑似患者的病情。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《内科护理学》</strong>（尤黎明、吴瑛主编）：国内护理本科核心教材</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Lewis&#39;s Medical-Surgical Nursing&quot; (Harding)</strong>：全球最畅销的内外科护理教材</li>\n<li><strong>中国 2 型糖尿病防治指南</strong>（最新版）：糖尿病管理的国家标准</li>\n<li><strong>中国心力衰竭诊断和治疗指南</strong>：心衰管理的循证推荐</li>\n<li><strong>AHA/ACC 急性心肌梗死管理指南</strong>：急性冠脉综合征的国际标准</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>内科护理的核心在于系统化的病情观察、规范化的用药管理和个体化的健康教育。呼吸系统疾病护理强调氧疗的精确控制和呼吸功能训练；循环系统疾病护理以液体管理和心功能监测为重点；糖尿病护理则需要护士成为患者自我管理的教育者和督导者。急危重症的早期识别是内科护士的救命能力——能够在第一时间识别异常、启动应急流程、为确定性治疗争取时间窗口。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学护理学 — 内科护理","id":"大学护理学-内科护理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、呼吸系统疾病护理","id":"一-呼吸系统疾病护理"},{"level":3,"text":"二、循环系统疾病护理","id":"二-循环系统疾病护理"},{"level":3,"text":"三、内分泌系统疾病护理","id":"三-内分泌系统疾病护理"},{"level":3,"text":"四、消化系统疾病护理","id":"四-消化系统疾病护理"},{"level":3,"text":"五、内科常见急症的早期识别","id":"五-内科常见急症的早期识别"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学护理学 — 基础护理技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-foundations/basic-nursing-skills"},"next":{"title":"大学护理学 — 外科护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/clinical-nursing/surgical-nursing"}}